  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0: Adds Unicode TrueType fonts with BaseFont.IdentityH, written as Type0 fonts with a ToUnicode map and subset when embedded. BaseFont.CreateFont with IdentityH now returns a Unicode font for a TrueType file, where it used to return the Windows-1252 one, and throws for a Base 14 font name. TextLayout never splits a surrogate pair or a combining sequence. See CHANGELOG.md for details.",
